Package: doolox
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Doolox <support@doolox.com>
Homepage: https://doolox.com
Depends: libc6, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Simple CMS and static website builder
 Doolox is a simple CMS and static website builder. It runs a local web
 server and lives in the system tray, and can generate a static site into
 the Websites folder in your home directory.
